{"id":"n41852-1-5","stage":2,"title":"년도 · 年度","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n41852-1-5-1","ko":"민준이가 올해로 스물여덟인가?","zh":"敏俊今年是二十八岁吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민준이가","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"민준이가","audio":"/audio/2d578794e58a65e57305.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민준이가","audio":"/audio/2d578794e58a65e57305.mp3"}},{"text":"올해로","meaning":"今年","explanation":"올해：今年；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"올해","audio":"/audio/8a0cd9bb73fb17e933c6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67842","senseId":"1","lemma":"올해","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올해로","audio":"/audio/5f3f2b6e04a000c0eacf.mp3"}},{"text":"스물여덟인가?","meaning":"28（固有数词）","explanation":"스물여덟：28（固有数词）；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ가：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"스물여덟인가","audio":"/audio/bbf4bba78a4a51abbf30.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"스물여덟인가","audio":"/audio/bbf4bba78a4a51abbf30.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8a0cd9bb73fb17e9","term":"올해","zh":"今年","audio":"/audio/8a0cd9bb73fb17e933c6.mp3","entryId":"67842","definition":"现在正在度过的这一年。","pronunciation":["올해"]}],"audio":"/audio/eb76f8dcd067ea8ade39.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n41852-1-5-2","ko":"응. 그럼 1986년도에 태어났겠네.","zh":"对。那他应该是1986年出生的吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}},{"text":"1